### ============================================================
### Social Media Platform - REST Client Test File
### Works with VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### Store the session cookie between requests.
### The REST Client automatically captures Set-Cookie responses
### and reuses them on subsequent requests. You don't need to
### manage it manually. To clear it, use the "Restart" command.

### ============================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK (Phase 1)
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Health check - should return 200 with environment info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 1.2 Unknown route - should return 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist


