### ---- Phase 7: Follows ----

### Test accounts: followone / StrongPass123 and followtwo / StrongPass456
### These accounts are already registered in the current development database.
### Use the profile response to copy followtwo's user id for the requests below.

### 7.1 Get the target user's profile and user id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/followtwo

### 7.2 Login as the follower (followone)
# @name phase7LoginA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "followone",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### 7.3 Follow followtwo - expect 201 on first follow
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOWTWO_USER_ID/follow

### 7.4 Follow followtwo again - expect 200, no duplicate relationship
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOWTWO_USER_ID/follow

### 7.5 Attempt to follow yourself - expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOWONE_USER_ID/follow

### 7.6 Get followtwo's followers - followone should be listed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/followtwo/followers?page=1&limit=10

### 7.7 Get followone's following list - followtwo should be listed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/followone/following?page=1&limit=10

### 7.8 Login as the other account to verify only the follower can unfollow
# @name phase7LoginB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "followtwo",
  "password": "StrongPass456"
}

### 7.9 Attempt to remove followone's relationship as followtwo - expect 200, unchanged
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOWONE_USER_ID/follow

### 7.10 Login back as followone before unfollowing
# @name phase7LoginAAgain
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "followone",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

### 7.11 Unfollow followtwo - expect 200 and isFollowing false
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOWTWO_USER_ID/follow

### 7.12 Unfollow again - expect 200, idempotent no-op
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOWTWO_USER_ID/follow

### 7.13 Follow without login - expect 401 (clear the REST Client cookie first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_FOLLOWTWO_USER_ID/follow

### 7.14 Follow with malformed user id - expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/not-a-valid-id/follow

### 7.15 Follow a valid but nonexistent user id - expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011/follow

### 6.19 Unfollow a user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID/follow